2 CONT Ivar Amundsson Uppigard-Sør-Sandbu
2 CONT
2 CONT I.Kleiven: I gamle daagaa, som finst på Deichmanske i Oslo er det med ei ukjent hånd skrivi til dette på side 305. "Ivar Ogmundson Gjesling, død på Lesja og ble begravet der i 1634,Epitaphium av tre fandtes i Folldals kirke i 1914
2 CONC .Er antagelig blitt med da den gamle kirke paa Lesja ble flyttet til Folldal"
2 CONT
2 CONT I 1607 var han lensmann i Vågå,eit ombud som han truleg hadde hatt nokre år,Han budde på Harildstad til ikring 1600,Då flutte han åt Sandbu og leigde bort Harildstad åt frenden sin Amund Engebretsson Fougner.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han var i 1615 den største jordeigaren i Vågå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Det var i heile Gudbrandsdalen berre få som åtte meire:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mikkel Blakar,Rike-Erland Tofte og Endre Hågå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han var gift to gonger. 5 born i Fyrste ekteskap og 4 i andre. From Ivar Kleiven "In Old Daagaa" page 304 Ivar was the youngest of the brothers, but he is the one we find most about. He could write and led accounting, and there ar
2 CONC e several type of before 1600 from his hand. He was lagrettesmann, sheriff, he was also a time. He had evidently knowledge of the law, so people have sought his advice.  He was sitting with both the two large farms, Sandbu and Har
2 CONC ildstad. Sandbu with a party of vagina Voll was 5 hides, but of these owned his mother just 3½ skin. It has therefore been replaced soil in an older part. Harildstad with Sperstad was 5 hides, and of those owned his father two hid
2 CONC es. When his father had a sister, a belief that she had received a skin. It then becomes again 2 hides in smålotter other hands, and these were mostly collected by the son Paal Harildstad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ivar stayed at Harildstad in 1585. He had been churchwarden in three years. His brother Tjøstolv was at Melby. The two brothers were the church verger in the following years, in 1586, 1587 and 1588. In the receipt for this time it
2 CONC  is mentioned outlays "for a new church that edification." It may therefore seem that Ivar has stood for church construction in Kvikne before moving to Sandbu. There he has come in 1596 or slightly earlier, for a diploma from the 
2 CONC year (in the collection by Jon Harildstad) stated that "Iver Asmundsen Sandbu» wins a case about Skedsmo in Ase (Ose?) In Vaga.
2 CONT
2 CONT Over Teacher Per Berg, Hamar, writes in NST XV (1955-1956), page 82:  "Ivar Sandbu was married twice - prince his wife heitte Rønnoug, the other Kari. Hr. Hougen believe that the prince wife "arguably called Rønnoug Sjugurdsdatter
2 CONC " (XIII, p. 308). Supposing he was married Rønnoug Lodvarsdatter Delete? Ein Lyt most tru after the opposition lead in Harildstadarkivet. In dei notes Ivar Harildstad has led over what he had will remain there, it says: "Anders Bo
2 CONC er Stad 1 dr. Who Lodve Deleting Lonthe hannom och Fech Iffuer Harildstad for: n dall paa swap effter Sallig Lodve death.". "
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
