1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://books.google.no/books?id=Vcg_AAAAYAAJ&pg=PA406&lpg=PA406&dq=Jens+Rostvig+inger+ugerup&source=bl&ots=IuEZgd37oe&sig=1pt-VD0enTDtZ9ObN8suBRXY5-o&hl=en&sa=X&ei=RIwHT7XxGK-L4gTG9L2NCA&sqi=2&redir_esc=y#v=onepage
