1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I skiftet etter hans far i 1602 arvet han som sin bror Gunnar 1/2 hud i Gutu på Ringebu. I tillegg ble han eir av 1 hud i Sandbu i Vågå eller Sel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Lodversen Slette was born in about 1560, and in 161915 he rose to be bykselmann [tenant farmer] at Slette in Heidal. He died in 1638 and had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Den 18. mars i 1616 makeskiftet han en 1/2 hud i gården Snerle med sin bror Eirik mot å få en 1/2 hud i Sygard Horgen i Heidal. I 1629 fikk han overtatt ytterligere 3 schind i Sygard Horgen fra sin bror Eirik. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Rönnoug Olsdatter ( ? - circa 1679), was married to Ole Olsen (1610 - 1679), who in 1668 owned Söndre Horgen and who in 1669 acquired the deed to Slette. They died childless and made Oluf Pedersen Slette their heir general.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eldri Olsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbro Olufsdatter, was married to Paul Christensen Ellingsbö in Vågå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kari Olufsdatter, was married to Oluf Bue in Sel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Magnhild Olufsdatter, was married at Grytlieng farm in Fron.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Lodversen was son of Lodver Slette, who died in 1602, and who in 1570 and 1593 rose to be bykselmann [tenant farmer] at Slette. He was again, son of Erik Slette, who in 1528 paid 1 lodd16 of silver in tax.
2 CONT
2 CONT
