1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Karen (Kari) Dyresdotter (16th Century)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Dyresdotter was a member of the prominent '''Lunner lineage''' (Dyre Sevaldsson’s family) and played a central role in the transmission of significant allodial lands across Eastern Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parentage and Inheritance'''
2 CONT * '''Father''': '''Dyre Sevaldsson''' of Hanestad.
2 CONT * '''Mother''': Her mother’s lineage brought rights to the '''Hove''' estate in Fåberg. In 1548, Karen consolidated her ownership of Hove by exchanging her paternal lands (Rolstad in Fron and Skorset in Fåberg) and a silver belt w
2 CONC ith her maternal aunt, Åse Bjørnsdotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage and Social Status'''
2 CONT Karen married '''Bent Andersson (Hård)''', also known as "Bent Hård." He served as the '''Lagmann (lawspeaker) of Oppland''' (1548–1555) and previously as a bailiff (''fogd'') in Toten (1538). Their marriage likely took place arou
2 CONC nd 1538, marking a union between a high-ranking legal official and a daughter of the powerful Hanestad estate.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Legal Disputes'''
2 CONT After her husband's death, Karen's children were involved in extensive litigation to protect their inheritance. In 1572, her sons-in-law (Hr. Rasmus and Hr. Pål) represented their wives in a case regarding the division of properti
2 CONC es at '''Kirke-Hole''' (Ringerike), Hanestad, and Sørum.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Eline-Haard-Eli-Eline/6000000001669609151?through=6000000017651592713 Elin Bentsdotter] (Hård): Married [https://www.geni.com/people/Sogneprest-til-Våle-Rasmus-Sørensen-Frendesonius/60000000059118142
2 CONC 75?through=6000000001669609151 Rasmus Søvrensson], the parish priest in Våle (d. 1599). They are the parents of [https://www.geni.com/people/Beritte-Nordre-Sørby/6000000017651592713?through=6000000005911814275 Beritte Sørby].
2 CONT # '''Kristine Bentsdotter''' Hård: Married 1) Kristoffer Nilsson and 2) Pål Nilsson, both parish priests in Sande. Her son, Bent Kristoffersson Hård, also became a priest in Våle.
2 CONT # '''Dyre Bentsson''': (Likely son) Died in 1565.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT * '''Christiansen, Per Reidar Bjørnerud''': "Dyre Sevaldssons Ætt", NST 35/4 (1996), pp. 387-435.
2 CONT * '''Vigerust, Tore H'''.: "Dyre Sevaldssons ætt eller Lunner-ætten", Slekt og data 1995, No. 3. [https://admin.slektogdata.no/sites/default/files/2019-08/1995-3.pdf P. 18-19].
2 CONT ———————————————
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.oavesthagen.no/Mine_aner.htm Ole Arild Vesthagen: Mine aner] - nr. 20732-2<br/>
