2 CONT
2 CONT Reference Number: HGP
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: REIDAR KNUTSON BARKELAND b: ABT 1553 in Jelsa, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: ANNA STEINSDATTER SÆBØ b: ABT 1559 in Sæbø, Hjelmeland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 BELYD ELLINGSDTR ØYE b: in Øye, Hjelmeland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 2 KIRSTI JONSDTR FOSS TØTLAND b: 1595 in Norway
2 CONT
