1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Peder Olsen Røssum, born around 1610, married around 1636 to Eldri Olsdatter Slette, died in 1672, 2 children. Peder Olsen Røssum had like his brothers inherited half a hide in the farm, but had also in 1638 paid h
2 CONC is oldest brother Ivar 129 "riksdaler" (old norweigian dollars" for a letter stating that he will give away all his right of inheritance in the farm. By two rights (note?) issued on Juanuary 16, 1665, he bought two of his brothers
2 CONC  inheritence in Røssum, a total of 1 hide.  On May 30, 1672, Eldri Røssum's property was divided.  They owned at that time 1 1/2 (1.5) hides in the farm with a lease "that the father will keep undivided for as he lives, as his chi
2 CONC ldren also agree"
2 CONT
2 CONT http://home.online.no/~jgroland/roland/pafg510.htm#13943
