1 NAME Ola Person /Røssum/
2 GIVN Ola Person
2 SURN Røssum
2 _MARNM Slette
1 NAME Ole Pedersen Røssum
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1645
2 PLAC Røssum
2 ADDR
3 CITY Kvam
3 STAE Østlandet
3 CTRY Norge
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1708
2 PLAC Slette gård
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vågå (now Heidal), Gudbrandsdal
3 STAE Østlandet
3 CTRY Norge
1 OCCU Drev Slette 1668-1708
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ole Pedersen Røssum (later called Slette) born at Røssum 1645, died at Slette 1708. Married in 1671 to Marit Thorstensdatter Hjelle, born at Dovre aprox 1650, died at Slette after 1708. Ole Pedersen Slette Røssum w
2 CONC as by the earlier mentioned will, sole heir to his fathers brother and mothers sister to Slette.  By a note of January 16, 1665 he had gotten 4 hides in Røssum and by a note of October 12, 1681 another 1/2 hide in the farm.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Olsen Røssum, born around 1610, married Rønnaug Olsdatter Slette around 1636, He died in 1679. As mentioned earlier he became the lessee at Slette when his parents in-law died, but purchased the farm in 1669. He adopted the na
2 CONC me Slette. Ole Olsen Slette (Røssum) and Rønnaug Slette did not get any children. On October 21, 1671, they therefore wrote a will saying that their fosterson Ole Pedersen Røssum should get everything.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was very well off, as we can see from the division of his property at Slette, April 6, 1708. His property consisted of the following Real Estate; 5 hides in Slette, 1 hide in Horgen, 2 hides in Røssum, 2 skins in Volden, 3 skin
2 CONC s in Aamot, 1 hide and 6 skings in Upper Bilben, 1 hide and 6 skins in Lower Bilben, 1 hide in Lien, 6 skins in Espelvnd and 1 hide and 1 skin in Killi at Dovre. A total of 14 hide and 5 skins in Real Estate. Slette with Horgen, h
2 CONC e inherited from his fathers brother and mothers sister and Killi he presumable got with his wife who came from the rich Hjelle family.  The rest he purchased; 1 hide and 6 skins in upper Bilben from his fathers brother Haldo Olse
2 CONC n by a note of may 18, 1682 for 130 riksdaler. 3 skins in Aamot by a note of Feb. 6, 1683, 1 hide in Lien and 6 skins in Espelund from Tittmester (an old title) Brockdorph by a note of January 23, 1686.  From Captain O. Bruun he b
2 CONC ought by a note of May 3, 1676 2 skins in lower Bilben, the rest of this farm he got by an exchange with the crown of Dec. 20, 1703.  He had 4 children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.lunby.net/slekt/1635.htm
