1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ole Olsen Røssum, born around 1610, married  Rønnaug Olsdatter Slette around 1636, He died in 1679. As mentioned earlier he became the lessee at Slette when his parents in-law died, but purchased the farm in 1669. 
2 CONC He adopted the name Slette. Ole Olsen Slette (Røssum) and  Rønnaug Slette did not get any children. On October 21, 1671, they therefore wrote a will saying that their fosterson Ole Pedersen Røssum should get everything.
