2 CONT On April 2nd 1656 eight  prominent Molde citizens sent a petitition to his Royal Highness King Fredrik 3, asking permission to build a parish church in Molde, signed Ouden Aagesen, Gjert Davidsen, Rasmus Mortensen, Henrick Jonsen,
