1 NAME Strange Jørgensen /Jørgensen/
2 GIVN Strange Jørgensen
2 SURN Jørgensen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 APR 1539
2 ADDR
3 CITY Faaborg Municipality
3 STAE Syddanmark
3 CTRY Denmark
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 FEB 1610
