2 CONT Apparently before she married Olle Trondsen, Ragnhild m. Joen Biornsen, and had children:  Berte Joensdatter (m. Peder Svenkesen, Birkeland); and Signe Joensdatter (m. Willum Trondsen Froysland - d. 1677) & Signe's skifte was 5 Fe
2 CONC bruary 1695.  Willum & Signe had children:  Jon W., Trond W., Siri W., Ingerid W. (19 in 1677 at Willum's skifte), and Todne W., ugift.  In 1695, Joen W. was at Halsaa; Tron W. at Foreid in Tveit; Siri W. was widow of Salve Erikse
2 CONC n Hogsaas; Ingeri m. Ole Kiddelsen, Tofte in Halsaa.
