1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Agnes Haakonsdatter=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Håkon V Magnusson, King of Norway and nn Sigurdsdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''*
2 CONT https://snl.no/Jon_Havtoresson. '''Store norske leksikon'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ..Jon var eldste sønn av Havtore Jonsson til Sørum (Sudrheim) på Romerike og '''kong Håkon 5''' Magnussons uekte datter''' Agnes.''' ...
2 CONT **
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes was the daughter of Haakon, but never a princess of Norway due to a dispute
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agnes_Haakonsdatter  Her descendants claimed the throne for generations as the https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudreim_claim
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agnes_H%C3%A5konsdotte
2 CONT * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agnes_Haakonsdatter
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Haakonsdatter-30
2 CONT * http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00298551&tree=LEO
2 CONT * http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I36057&tree=2
2 CONT * http://snl.no/.nbl_biografi/Agnes_H%C3%A5konsdatter/utdypning
2 CONT * https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/GGR9-YVR
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Håkonsdatter til Sudreim, 7 Born: Cir 1292 Married: 1302 Died: 1319, Sørum (Sudreim, Skedjuhof)), Sørum, Akershus, Norway General Notes: Jomfru Agnes var Kong Håkon V.s eldste datter. Her mother is not known. She was engaged
2 CONC  to Mr. Havtore in 1302. (Isl. Ann. IV, V). At that time she was hardly much more than 10 years old. The marriage between them can therefore only have been entered into several years later, probably around 1307. In dowry with the 
2 CONC wife, Mr. Havtore by King Håkon 15 smaller farms on Romerike, but the king revoked this disposition. Instead, he donated 6 markebol in Sorknes in Solør to hr. Havtore and Mrs. Agnes, presumably this whole farm. The diploma is date
2 CONC d Bergen 09.01.1312 (DN I 132): Fra, Bind III 1301-1319, nr. 756: Agnes married Havtore Jonsson Roos til Sudreim, son of Jon Raud Ivarsson Roos til Sudreim and Unknown, in 1302. (Havtore Jonsson Roos til Sudreim was born circa 127
2 CONC 5 and died in 1320 in Sørum (Sudreim, Skedjuhof)), Sørum, Akershus, Norway.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Updated 02 November 2002. Contact: Ken Nygaard
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes married Havtore Jonsson Roos til Sudreim, son of Jon Raud Ivarsson Roos til Sudreim and Unknown, in 1302. (Havtore Jonsson Roos til Sudreim was born circa 1275 and died in 1320 in Sørum (Sudreim, Skedjuhof)), Sørum, Akershus
2 CONC , Norway .)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes was born to one of Håkon's concubines.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Beth Sundstad June 8, 2009 at 4:12 pm
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Hakonardottir, Dame of Borgarsyssel, illegitimate though recognized, by a mistress named Gro or Katrine.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Per-Kristian Dammerud on 3/22/09
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: Approx. 1292
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Havtore Jonsson Roos To Sudreim in 1302
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 1319, Sørum (Sudreim, Skedjuhof)), Sørum, Akershus, Norway at the age of about 27 years
2 CONT
2 CONT General notes:
2 CONT
