2 CONT * Married (2) - '''Vetride Borgarsen;'''
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Torleiv Saksebjørnsson =
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Ogmund Torleivsson;'''  He settled in Hybbestad in Tjølling in 1370, but took over Lindheim when his brother Bjørn became governor. He had, as far as we know, four sons
2 CONT * '''Bjørn Torleivsen;''' died after 1397 at Bjørntvet in Solum.  Married Elin Torgeirsdatter Dylla
2 CONT
