1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ==Magnus of Orkney==
2 CONT
2 CONT MAGNUS V, Jarl of Orkney and Earl of Caithness (?) 1311 to 1321
2 CONT or a. 1329. On 28 Oct. 1 312 he witnessed the treaty of Inverness between
2 CONT King Robert I and Hakon V, King of Norway (1299 to 1319), and on 6 Apr. 1320 he signed the Letter of the Scottish Nobles to the Pope, John X X I I . He may have d. before 4 Aug. 1321 , and was certainly dead by 1329, when his wido
2 CONC w granted a charter as such. Jarl Magnus V Johnsson, the last of the Angus line, m. Katherine, whose parentage is not recorded, and d. about I329.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Complete peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, extant, extinct, or dormant, vol 10, appendix A, p. 30. https://dcms.lds.org/delivery/DeliveryManagerServlet?dps_pid=IE934240
