1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Tore Olsson was either born at Vadla in Hjelmeland or Marvik in Jelsa. He paid tax as a farm renter from 1613 to 1633.  Tore owned 1 laup 1/2 pund smør at Høyland in 1617.  From 1634, he paid tax on 2 laupar smør as a landowner.  
2 CONC Tore served as a lagrettemann between 1616 and 1636.  In 1634, he had to pay a fine for having intimate relations with his fiance.  In 1617 he was also owner of 4 spann grain at Eskeland, Idse skipreide.  In 1664 he owned 18 mark 
2 CONC at Vervik, Strand,
