1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Even though Cecilia Jonsdotter (Sudreim) may have had children and even grandchildren, a diploma from 1445:[http://www.dokpro.uio.no/perl/middelalder/diplom_vise_tekst.prl?b=13631&s=n&str= DN XVI:151]., shows that 
2 CONC all her descendants were dead before 1445. Her closest living relatives according to the diploma were her grandnephews and grandnieces. She had no issue left. Tore Vigerust found this information confirmed also in 16th century doc
2 CONC uments in Ervallaarkivet. Thus, Åsa Ulfsdotter possibly couldn't have been a daughter of Ulf Holmgeirsson and Cecilia Jonsdotter.  Thus they left no known issue in Onsøy and they can possibly not be connected to the Rosensverd Fam
2 CONC ily. But they did have a daughter mentioned in SDHK 20683, 1426, "Skiidha" i Norge: Where Katarina Ulfsdotter confirms her mother Cecilia Johansdotters gift of "Forsvika" kvarn too Vadstena kloster. Tore H. Vigerust found that Åsa
2 CONC  Ulvsdatter could have been a daughter of Ulv Jonsson Roos, but after researching additional Sources he later find this not to be true, and Åsas parents is still unknown. But the ownership of Elingård does give us a Clue that ther
2 CONC e might be a relation to the Family that owned earlier, but how is still unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT H. J. Huitfeldt-Kaas uppger i Personalhist. Tidsskr. 1:6, att Karl Ulfsson hade en son Ture och en syster '''Åsa''', men filiationerna ha ej kunnat verifieras i de av honom anförda källorna, och deras sigill äro ej kända.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lejonbalk#TAB_4
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hun kunne ifølge Tore Vigerust være uektefødt datter av Ulv Jonsson Roos, noe han senere skal ha gått bort fra og hennes opphav er derfor ukjent..
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
