1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 2.1.3.2.2.1. Oluf Lauridsen. 2.1.3.2.2.2. Otte Lauridsen Seefeld, died during the seven years war. 2.1.3.2.2.3. Viffert Lauridsen, died in battle 20 October 1565 at Svarteraa. 2.1.3.2.2.4. Enevold Lauridsen, killed
2 CONC  whilst sleeping in his chair at Riberhus. 2.1.3.2.2.5. Christoffer Lauridsen til Refsnaes, born 4 November 1543, died 2 March 1612, buried 16 March 1612, married 14 February 1580 
2 CONT                          Else Nielsdatter Benderup til Kvottrup (died about 1642, buried N?rre Kongerslev church).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.5.1. Laurids Seefeld, born about 1581, died after 1612. 2.1.3.2.2.5.2. Mourids Seefeld, died young. 2.1.3.2.2.5.3. Christen Seefeld, died young. 2.1.3.2.2.5.4. Enevold Seefeld, died young. 2.1.3.2.2.5.5. Viffert Seefeld 
2 CONC til Refsnaes, Viffertsholm and Tustrup, born 31 October 1588 at Refsnaes, died 24 October 1662 at Viffertsholm. 2.1.3.2.2.5.6. Enevold Seefeld til Kjellerup, died 1643, married Anne J?rgensdatter Urne (died 1651). 2.1.3.2.2.5.7. J
2 CONC ?rgen Seefeld til Refsnaes, born 7 March 1594 at Refsnaes, died 28 February 1662 at Copenhagen. 2.1.3.2.2.5.8. Anne, died young. 2.1.3.2.2.5.9. Anne, died before 12 February 1652. 2.1.3.2.2.5.10. Marine til Refsnaes and Viffertsho
2 CONC lm, died 1678, aged almost 100!
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.2.6. Kirsten, married Jens Munk til Havbro. 2.1.3.2.2.7. Anne til Asfaerg, alive 1580, married Anders Munk. 2.1.3.2.2.8. Else til Komdrup, alive 1580.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.3.2.3. N. N., married Niels Brun til Kongstedlund. 2.1.3.3. Ellen, died after 1509, married Mads Jensen Viffert til Kongstedlund. 2.1.3.4. Ide, died after 1519, married Thomes Pedersen lf i Vesterbaek, died after 1499. 2.1.4. 
2 CONC Sophie til Refsnaes, died after 1497, married after 1477 Knud Thomesen Vognsen af H?rbylund (died before 1485). 2.1.5. Ellen, died after 1472 a nun at ?rslev Abbey. 2.1.6. N. N., married Las Bratze Saltensee af Linde (died after 1
2 CONC 496). 2.1.7. Anne, died after 1486 at Mariager Abbey. 2.1.8. Inger, died after 1464, married Niels Pedersen Skovgaard til Egenbjerg.
2 CONT --------------------
