2 CONT James Hepburn, 1st and last Duke of Orkney|b. c 1535\nd. 14 Apr 1578|p10190.htm#i101892|Patrick Hepburn, 3rd Earl of Bothwell|b. bt 1511 - 1513\nd. Sep 1556|p10833.htm#i108326|Agnes Sinclair|d. bt 21 Mar 1572 - 22 Feb 1575|p482.ht
2 CONC m#i4820|Adam Hepburn, 2nd Earl of Bothwell|b. c 1492\nd. 9 Sep 1513|p481.htm#i4810|Agnes Stewart|d. c Feb 1557|p10832.htm#i108317|Henry Sinclair, 3rd Lord Sinclair|d. 9 Sep 1513|p10929.htm#i109283|Margaret Hepburn|d. bt 11 Jun 154
