0 @N6000000002322323555@ NOTE Married a Norwegian King, King Eric II. Their daughter, Margaret, the Maid of
1 CONT Norway, was the only living descendant of Alexander III, both sons and
1 CONT daughter having predeceased him, so the infant Margaret was appointed as heir
1 CONT to the throne and succeeded her grandfather to the throne of Scotland when he
1 CONT died in 1286.
